{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1598227200, "end_date": 1598918399, "month_true_total": 28, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:05:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "75126934", "author": {"steamid": "76561198113073429", "personaname": "Yudru", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198113073429/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 45132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20457, "last_played": 1766247379, "avatar": "d749e310c05bf002d917f4ac5479d37a861b855b"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Cojonudo, tanto si juegas solo como con amigos. Divertido y en ocasiones es un verdadero reto. Lo mejor es que sigue creciendo, se sigue actualizando con mas misiones nuevos bichos, mejoras en biomas en skins etc... Realmente espero que no dejen las actualizaciones.", "timestamp_created": 1598730046, "timestamp_updated": 1598730046, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75121640", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093358844", "personaname": "DLD|TheResistant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198093358844/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 12543, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4521, "last_played": 1779326205, "avatar": "b506f2127aa1422c75c6b36b93d65847331ac822"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Para mí, mi juego del año. Son pocos los juegos con los cuales no me aburro. La comunidad y el sentido de pertenencia de este juego va más allá que cualquier otro. El arte y diseño desde los personajes hasta los biomas son una locura. Si te formas un grupo de 4 amigos para empezar, no vas a poder dejarlo. ROCK AND STONE, BROTHER", "timestamp_created": 1598722537, "timestamp_updated": 1598722537, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75032781", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114103058", "personaname": "Omega", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198114103058/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 3576, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2528, "last_played": 1754718974, "avatar": "591812d9a63f0d4bbc458de3773428810760b0b1"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Este juego es la re ostia! Aguante los enanos peronistas!", "timestamp_created": 1598579836, "timestamp_updated": 1598579836, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74957003", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148557533", "personaname": "El Facha Finwe", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148557533/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 2223, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1393, "last_played": 1752165839, "avatar": "5cb84b02514cd13bd1ad5e50741578b161d0557c"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "dejame", "timestamp_created": 1598469776, "timestamp_updated": 1688756008, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74904496", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116377484", "personaname": "Choperito", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Choperito/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 74575, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 159, "playtime_at_review": 68358, "last_played": 1787612667, "avatar": "45fdcdead492b2f21afd217b532cc7f32c1412ca"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "I wrote a simply review few years ago, when i had almost 500 hours in this game. Today i want you to give you a honest one. \n\nWith more than 1k hours, i think that in recent years theres no game like Deep Rock Galactic. \nI started playing when the covid-19 pandemic was hitting hard the news. The atmosphere, the friendly community were crucial to me. I really like the product, the combination between dwarfs, explore caves and kill bugs together is amazing. \n\nA week ago the season 6 was launched. So if you start playing today, you would have a lot of things to enjoy. Each previous season has 100 levels, you complete every level to get point that you can exchange for rewards. Theres a lot of cosmetics, available mods and weapons to try. \n\nThis game changed my life, and could change yours too!", "timestamp_created": 1598382747, "timestamp_updated": 1770427029, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}